    where :math:`i \in \left\{0, \; \cdots , \; \text{x.size}(0) - 1\right\}`
    and :math:`i \neq y`.

    Optionally, you can give non-equal weighting on the classes by passing
    a 1D :attr:`weight` tensor into the constructor.

    The loss function then becomes:

